  "ruleText": "Pes 701.01 Statement of Purpose. The purpose of these rules is to list the prohibited, prohibited-limited and restricted use pesticides and the basic requirements for their sale and use in New Hampshire.\n\nSource. #150, eff 1-9-74; ss by #2209, eff 12-13-82; ss by #2781, eff 7-26-84; ss by #4867, eff 7-19-90; ss and moved by #6160, eff 1-3-96 (from Pes 701.03); ss by #7987, eff 1-3-04, EXPIRED: 1-3-12\n\nNew. #10489, INTERIM, eff 12-17-13, EXPIRED: 6-16-14\n\nNew. #10712, eff 11-5-14; ss by #14064, eff 8-22-24",
